d a couple of the letters into roman numerals to indicate the year in which it was completed: 1732.\n&lt;p&gt;This is yet another location where the Von Trapp children sang.&lt;\/p&gt;\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2017\/08\/DSC_1449\/3755888388.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">In the Church Square (or <i>Kapitelplatz<\/i>), you will find a pond. Back in the 1700s, when it was built, it served as a horse bath. The inscription on top says: <i>Leopold the Prince built me<\/i>. The artist also cleverly turned a couple of the letters into roman numerals to indicate the year in which it was completed: 1732.\n<p>This is yet another location where the Von Trapp children sang.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/DSC_1434.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"A watercourse is built through the hill to supply the city with water from the Alps during the 12th century. That water was used to flush the cities every Thursday. This is probably one of the reasons why the city was not hit by the plague.\" data-attachment-id=\"2040\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"A watercourse is built through the hill to supply the city with water from the Alps during the 12th century. That water was used to flush the cities every Thursday. This is probably one of the reasons why the city was not hit by the plague.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2017\/08\/DSC_1434\/2961040845.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">A watercourse is built through the hill to supply the city with water from the Alps during the 12th century. That water was used to flush the cities every Thursday. This is probably one of the reasons why the city was not hit by the plague.<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/DSC_1440.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"St. Peter&#039;s Abbey built a mill in the location where the water comes out of the hill. This mill is considered to power the oldest bakery in Salzburg.\" data-attachment-id=\"2041\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"St. Peter&#039;s Abbey built a mill in the location where the water comes out of the hill. This mill is considered to power the oldest bakery in Salzburg.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2017\/08\/DSC_1440\/4119719094.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">St. Peter's Abbey built a mill in the location where the water comes out of the hill. This mill is considered to power the oldest bakery in Salzburg.<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/DSC_1424.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"St. Peter&#039;s Abbey was built in 696 and is the oldest church in Salzburg. It houses the &lt;i&gt;Stiftskeller&lt;\/i&gt; Restaurant, which is said to be the oldest restaurant in Europe. (The interior of the Abbey is far more impressive than the exterior.)\" data-attachment-id=\"2037\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"St. Peter&#039;s Abbey was built in 696 and is the oldest church in Salzburg. It houses the &lt;i&gt;Stiftskeller&lt;\/i&gt; Restaurant, which is said to be the oldest restaurant in Europe. (The interior of the Abbey is far more impressive than the exterior.)\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2017\/08\/DSC_1424\/3640365261.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">St. Peter's Abbey was built in 696 and is the oldest church in Salzburg. It houses the <i>Stiftskeller<\/i> Restaurant, which is said to be the oldest restaurant in Europe. (The interior of the Abbey is far more impressive than the exterior.)<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/DSC_1429.jpg\